#. i18n: file: calevents.ui:45
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, ohExplainLabel)
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"You can download a calendar for your country from http://www.icalshare.com/ "
"or other sites.\n"
"This is fully optional. All the events from this calendar will be printed "
"red."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst en Kalenner för Dien Land op http://www.icalshare.com/ un op anner "
"Sieden finnen.\n"
"Du kannst dat doon, man bruukst dat nich. All Begeefnissen ut dissen "
"Kalenner warrt root druckt."

#. i18n: file: calevents.ui:74
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, fhHeaderLabel)
#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Select an optional calendar file with your \"family holidays\""
msgstr "Köörwies en Kalennerdatei mit Dien \"Familien-Fierdaag\" utsöken"

#. i18n: file: calevents.ui:97
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, fhExplainLabel)
#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"You can create such a calendar using KOrganizer or any other calendar "
"program.\n"
"This is fully optional. All the events from this calendar will be printed "
"green."
msgstr ""
"So en Kalenner kannst Du mit KOrganizer oder jichtenseen anner "
"Kalennerprogramm opstellen.\n"
"Du kannst dat doon, man bruukst dat nich. All Begeefnissen ut dissen "
"Kalenner warrt gröön druckt."

